{{Term/Store|Big Hearty Radish|Big Hearty Radishes|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Big Hearty Radish}}
Big Hearty Radishes are flora that are found in various grassy areas of [[Hyrule]], characterized by their forked and flowering stalk. The [[Vegetable]] itself cannot be seen until it is picked, as it is a root. As their name implies, Big Hearty Radishes are larger versions of the [[Hearty Radish]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

Big Hearty Radishes can be eaten raw to restore four [[Heart]]s. If a Big Hearty Radish is roasted over a [[Campfire]], it becomes a [[Roasted Big Radish]]. If a Big Hearty Radish is [[Cooking|Cooked]] in a [[Cooking Pot]], the resulting [[Food]] will grant [[Link]] [[Extra Hearts]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Big Hearty Radishes are one of the ingredients that can be used to make [[Peach Dye]].

