==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Big Hearty Radish}}
Big Hearty Radishes are [[Vegetable]]s that can be found growing on [[Sky Island]]s. They can also be grown by [[Uma]] at the [[School's Field]] in [[Hateno Village]], though due to her inexperience in growing them, she can only raise two at a time.<ref name="TotK Uma"/> Big Hearty Radishes are marked by [[Flower]]s growing off of them.

They restore all of [[Link]]'s [[Heart]]s to his [[Life Gauge]] and grant him several [[Extra Hearts]] when [[Cooking|Cooked]] into [[Meal]]s.<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> When exposed to [[Fire]] or [[Scorching Climate]]s, they become into [[Roasted Big Radish]]es.

